						<string name="Name">READ ME FOR INSTRUCTIONS</string>
						<ProtectedString name="Source">--DONT PUT THIS IN ANYTHING IT&apos;S JUST INSTRUCTIONS.
--First Place the &quot;PUT THIS IN THE WEAPON&quot; script in your Weapon or Tool.
--Then place your Weapon or Tool in the &quot;PUT THE WEAPON IN THIS BRICK&quot; brick.

--IMPORTANT (OPTINAL)
--Before doing anything you should put the Weapon or Tool in the giver where you want it.</ProtectedString>
					</Properties>
				</Item>
			</Item>
